# Expo
.expo/
# `expo export` output (the `build` task's bundle check)
dist/
# Native projects are generated (`npx expo prebuild`), never committed (docs/technical/mobile/mobile-app.md §15.5).
# Anchored to the app's root: a bare `ios/` would also hide the local Expo modules' own native sources
# (modules/pdf-renderer/ios and /android, ADR 056), leaving a development build without them.
/ios/
/android/
# What Gradle builds inside a local module's Android sources.
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/.gradle/
